      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this extended 2 bedroom, 2 bathroom mid-terrace family home to the Dublin 12 property market. Ideally positioned on the mature and highly sought-after Stannaway Road in Crumlin, No. 262 comes to the market in fantastic condition throughout, having been freshly painted from top to bottom. This turn-key property represents a phenomenal opportunity for first-time buyers, growing families, or astute investors seeking a solid home in a proven, central location. \nThe location is second to none. Stannaway Road is a peaceful, established residential road positioned within easy walking distance of Crumlin Village, Kimmage, and Sundrive, offering a vast array of local amenities including primary and secondary schools, supermarkets, independent cafes, and sports facilities. Green spaces like Stannaway Park, Sundrive Park, and Bushy Park are all nearby. Transport options are exceptional, with major bus corridors right on your doorstep offering fast, direct access into Dublin City Centre, while the M50 motorway is easily accessible by car. \nInternal living accommodation is bright, spacious, and immaculately presented. Ground floor accommodation comprises an entrance hallway, a spacious lounge area, a second reception space, a fully fitted kitchen, and a convenient ground-floor WC, all finished with a stylish mix of wood and tile flooring throughout the lower level. Upstairs features two generous double bedrooms and a primary family bathroom suite. To the rear, No. 262 boasts a private, large rear garden with plenty of space to extend.\nViewing is highly advised. Call RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS today for further information or to arrange a viewing!\nAdditional Features;\n•BER C\n•C. 60 sq m \n•2 BED / 2 BATH \n•Mid-terrace family home \n•Turn key condition throughout\n•Large private rear garden \n•Two generous double bedrooms upstairs \n•Bright lounge & modern kitchen layout\n•Mature and highly sought-after Crumlin location \n•Prime bus routes directly on your doorstep into Dublin City Centre\n•Easy access to Crumlin Village, Kimmage, M50 & N7 \n•Ideal for First-Time Buyers, Downsizers, and Investors alike \nDirections\nTraveling along Sundrive Road towards Kimmage, turn right at the main crossroads onto Stannaway Road. Proceed straight along Stannaway Road past the green area, and No. 262 will be located on your right-hand side, clearly identified by our Ray Cooke Auctioneers 'For Sale' sign.\n"
      },
      {
